 "intro_zh": "景区拥有国际高尔夫球会、星级酒店、游艇俱乐部和国内首席养生谷等旅游业态，配套文化中心、大剧院、购物中心、葡萄酒堡、海水浴场等服务设施，形成了涵盖旅游观光、休闲度假、餐饮购物和工农业旅游等多样化旅游产品体系的综合性旅游度假区。",
 "intro_en": "Yantai, formerly Chefoo, is a coastal prefecture-level city on the Shandong Peninsula in China. Lying on the southern coast of the Bohai Strait, Yantai borders Qingdao on the southwest and Weihai on the east, with sea access to both the Bohai Sea (via the Laizhou Bay and the Bohai Strait) and the Yellow Sea (from both north and south sides of the Shandong Peninsula). It is the largest fishing seaport in Shandong. Its population was 7,102,116 during the 2020 census, of whom 3,184,299 lived in the built-up area made up of the 5 urban districts of Zhifu, Laishan, Fushan, Muping, and Penglai.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
